---
description: JS, accessibility, and quality gates for DailyDose+ pages
globs: "**/*.html"
alwaysApply: false
---

# JavaScript

- All JS in `<script>` at bottom of `<body>` — no external `.js` files
- `const`/`let` only; no `var`
- No inline `onclick=` — use `addEventListener`
- `IntersectionObserver` for scroll behaviors (ToS anchor nav, scroll-to-top sentinel) — not `scroll` listeners for visibility
- JS toggles classes; CSS handles transitions

# Accessibility

- `lang="en"` on `<html>`
- One `h1` per page; `h2` sections; `h3` subsections
- `aria-label` on icon-only buttons and interactive SVGs
- Focus: `outline-2 outline-primary` on focusable elements
- Never convey state by color alone — pair with icon or text

# Quality gates (before marking done)

- [ ] No console errors in Chrome
- [ ] Mobile layout at 375px (iPhone SE)
- [ ] Relative inter-page hrefs correct
- [ ] Tailwind config with all Vital Clarity tokens present
- [ ] Lexend loads (no system font fallback)
- [ ] Material Symbols render (not raw ligature text)
